{"id":30,"name":"الروم","transliteration":"Ar-Rum","translation_fr":"Les romains","translation_en":"The Romans","type":"meccan","total_verses":60,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"الٓمٓ","translation_fr":"Alif, Lâm, Mîm","translation_en":"Alif, Lam, Meem","transliteration":"Aliflammeem"},{"id":2,"text":"غُلِبَتِ ٱلرُّومُ","translation_fr":"Les Romains ont été vaincus","translation_en":"The Byzantines have been defeated","transliteration":"Ghulibati alrroomu"},{"id":3,"text":"فِيٓ أَدۡنَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَهُم مِّنۢ بَعۡدِ غَلَبِهِمۡ سَيَغۡلِبُونَ","translation_fr":"dans le pays voisin, et après leur défaite ils seront les vainqueurs","translation_en":"In the nearest land. But they, after their defeat, will overcome","transliteration":"Fee adna alardi wahum min baAAdi ghalabihim sayaghliboona"},{"id":4,"text":"فِي بِضۡعِ سِنِينَۗ لِلَّهِ ٱلۡأَمۡرُ مِن قَبۡلُ وَمِنۢ بَعۡدُۚ وَيَوۡمَئِذٖ يَفۡرَحُ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنُونَ","translation_fr":"dans quelques années. A Allah appartient le commandement, au début et à la fin, et ce jour-là les Croyants se réjouiront","translation_en":"Within three to nine years. To Allah belongs the command before and after. And that day the believers will rejoice","transliteration":"Fee bidAAi sineena lillahi alamru min qablu wamin baAAdu wayawmaithin yafrahu almuminoona"},{"id":5,"text":"بِنَصۡرِ ٱللَّهِۚ يَنصُرُ مَن يَشَآءُۖ وَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"du secours d'Allah. Il secourt qui Il veut et Il est le Tout Puissant, le Tout Miséricordieux","translation_en":"In the victory of Allah. He gives victory to whom He wills, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful","transliteration":"Binasri Allahi yansuru man yashao wahuwa alAAazeezu alrraheemu"},{"id":6,"text":"وَعۡدَ ٱللَّهِۖ لَا يُخۡلِفُ ٱللَّهُ وَعۡدَهُۥ وَلَٰكِنَّ أَكۡثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"C'est [là] la promesse d'Allah. Allah ne manque jamais à Sa promesse mais la plupart des gens ne savent pas","translation_en":"[It is] the promise of Allah. Allah does not fail in His promise, but most of the people do not know","transliteration":"WaAAda Allahi la yukhlifu Allahu waAAdahu walakinna akthara alnnasi la yaAAlamoona"},{"id":7,"text":"يَعۡلَمُونَ ظَٰهِرٗا مِّنَ ٱلۡحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنۡيَا وَهُمۡ عَنِ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ هُمۡ غَٰفِلُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils connaissent un aspect de la vie présente, tandis qu'ils sont inattentifs à l'au-delà","translation_en":"They know what is apparent of the worldly life, but they, of the Hereafter, are unaware","transliteration":"YaAAlamoona thahiran mina alhayati alddunya wahum AAani alakhirati hum ghafiloona"},{"id":8,"text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَتَفَكَّرُواْ فِيٓ أَنفُسِهِمۗ مَّا خَلَقَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَآ إِلَّا بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَأَجَلٖ مُّسَمّٗىۗ وَإِنَّ كَثِيرٗا مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ بِلِقَآيِٕ رَبِّهِمۡ لَكَٰفِرُونَ","translation_fr":"N'ont-ils pas médité en eux-mêmes? Allah n'a créé les cieux et la terre et ce qui est entre eux, qu'à juste raison et pour un terme fixé. Beaucoup de gens cependant ne croient pas en la rencontre de leur Seigneur","translation_en":"Do they not contemplate within themselves? Allah has not created the heavens and the earth and what is between them except in truth and for a specified term. And indeed, many of the people, in [the matter of] the meeting with their Lord, are disbelievers","transliteration":"Awalam yatafakkaroo fee anfusihim ma khalaqa Allahu alssamawati waalarda wama baynahuma illa bialhaqqi waajalin musamman wainna katheeran mina alnnasi biliqai rabbihim lakafiroona"},{"id":9,"text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَسِيرُواْ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ فَيَنظُرُواْ كَيۡفَ كَانَ عَٰقِبَةُ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبۡلِهِمۡۚ كَانُوٓاْ أَشَدَّ مِنۡهُمۡ قُوَّةٗ وَأَثَارُواْ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَعَمَرُوهَآ أَكۡثَرَ مِمَّا عَمَرُوهَا وَجَآءَتۡهُمۡ رُسُلُهُم بِٱلۡبَيِّنَٰتِۖ فَمَا كَانَ ٱللَّهُ لِيَظۡلِمَهُمۡ وَلَٰكِن كَانُوٓاْ أَنفُسَهُمۡ يَظۡلِمُونَ","translation_fr":"N'ont-ils pas parcouru la terre pour voir ce qu'il est advenu de ceux qui ont vécu avant eux? Ceux-là les surpassaient en puissance et avaient labouré et peuplé la terre bien plus qu'ils ne l'ont fait eux-mêmes. Leurs messagers leur vinrent avec des preuves évidentes. Ce n'est pas Allah qui leur fit du tort; mais ils se firent du tort à eux-mêmes","translation_en":"Have they not traveled through the earth and observed how was the end of those before them? They were greater than them in power, and they plowed the earth and built it up more than they have built it up, and their messengers came to them with clear evidences. And Allah would not ever have wronged them, but they were wronging themselves","transliteration":"Awalam yaseeroo fee alardi fayanthuroo kayfa kana AAaqibatu allatheena min qablihim kanoo ashadda minhum quwwatan waatharoo alarda waAAamarooha akthara mimma AAamarooha wajaathum rusuluhum bialbayyinati fama kana Allahu liyathlimahum walakin kanoo anfusahum yathlimoona"},{"id":10,"text":"ثُمَّ كَانَ عَٰقِبَةَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَسَـٰٓـُٔواْ ٱلسُّوٓأَىٰٓ أَن كَذَّبُواْ بِـَٔايَٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَكَانُواْ بِهَا يَسۡتَهۡزِءُونَ","translation_fr":"Puis, mauvaise fut la fin de ceux qui faisaient le mal, ayant traité de mensonges les versets d'Allah et les ayant raillés","translation_en":"Then the end of those who did evil was the worst [consequence] because they denied the signs of Allah and used to ridicule them","transliteration":"Thumma kana AAaqibata allatheena asaoo alssooa an kaththaboo biayati Allahi wakanoo biha yastahzioona"},{"id":11,"text":"ٱللَّهُ يَبۡدَؤُاْ ٱلۡخَلۡقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ ثُمَّ إِلَيۡهِ تُرۡجَعُونَ","translation_fr":"C'est Allah qui commence la création; ensuite Il la refait; puis, vers Lui vous serez ramenés","translation_en":"Allah begins creation; then He will repeat it; then to Him you will be returned","transliteration":"Allahu yabdao alkhalqa thumma yuAAeeduhu thumma ilayhi turjaAAoona"},{"id":12,"text":"وَيَوۡمَ تَقُومُ ٱلسَّاعَةُ يُبۡلِسُ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُونَ","translation_fr":"Et le jour où l'Heure arrivera, les criminels seront frappés de désespoir","translation_en":"And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will be in despair","transliteration":"Wayawma taqoomu alssaAAatu yublisu almujrimoona"},{"id":13,"text":"وَلَمۡ يَكُن لَّهُم مِّن شُرَكَآئِهِمۡ شُفَعَـٰٓؤُاْ وَكَانُواْ بِشُرَكَآئِهِمۡ كَٰفِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Et ils n'auront point d'intercesseurs parmi ceux qu'ils associaient [à Allah] et ils renieront même leurs divinités","translation_en":"And there will not be for them among their [alleged] partners any intercessors, and they will [then] be disbelievers in their partners","transliteration":"Walam yakun lahum min shurakaihim shufaAAao wakanoo bishurakaihim kafireena"},{"id":14,"text":"وَيَوۡمَ تَقُومُ ٱلسَّاعَةُ يَوۡمَئِذٖ يَتَفَرَّقُونَ","translation_fr":"Le jour où l'Heure arrivera, ce jour-là ils se sépareront [les uns des autres]","translation_en":"And the Day the Hour appears - that Day they will become separated","transliteration":"Wayawma taqoomu alssaAAatu yawmaithin yatafarraqoona"},{"id":15,"text":"فَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ فَهُمۡ فِي رَوۡضَةٖ يُحۡبَرُونَ","translation_fr":"Ceux qui auront cru et accompli de bonnes œuvres se réjouiront dans un jardin","translation_en":"And as for those who had believed and done righteous deeds, they will be in a garden [of Paradise], delighted","transliteration":"Faamma allatheena amanoo waAAamiloo alssalihati fahum fee rawdatin yuhbaroona"},{"id":16,"text":"وَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ وَكَذَّبُواْ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا وَلِقَآيِٕ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ فَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ فِي ٱلۡعَذَابِ مُحۡضَرُونَ","translation_fr":"et quant à ceux qui n'auront pas cru et auront traité de mensonges Nos signes ainsi que la rencontre de l'au-delà, ceux-là seront emmenés au châtiment","translation_en":"But as for those who disbelieved and denied Our verses and the meeting of the Hereafter, those will be brought into the punishment [to remain]","transliteration":"Waamma allatheena kafaroo wakaththaboo biayatina waliqai alakhirati faolaika fee alAAathabi muhdaroona"},{"id":17,"text":"فَسُبۡحَٰنَ ٱللَّهِ حِينَ تُمۡسُونَ وَحِينَ تُصۡبِحُونَ","translation_fr":"Glorifiez Allah donc, soir et matin","translation_en":"So exalted is Allah when you reach the evening and when you reach the morning","transliteration":"Fasubhana Allahi heena tumsoona waheena tusbihoona"},{"id":18,"text":"وَلَهُ ٱلۡحَمۡدُ فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَعَشِيّٗا وَحِينَ تُظۡهِرُونَ","translation_fr":"A Lui toute louange dans les cieux et la terre, dans l'après-midi et au milieu de la journée","translation_en":"And to Him is [due all] praise throughout the heavens and the earth. And [exalted is He] at night and when you are at noon","transliteration":"Walahu alhamdu fee alssamawati waalardi waAAashiyyan waheena tuthhiroona"},{"id":19,"text":"يُخۡرِجُ ٱلۡحَيَّ مِنَ ٱلۡمَيِّتِ وَيُخۡرِجُ ٱلۡمَيِّتَ مِنَ ٱلۡحَيِّ وَيُحۡيِ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ بَعۡدَ مَوۡتِهَاۚ وَكَذَٰلِكَ تُخۡرَجُونَ","translation_fr":"Du mort, Il fait sortir le vivant, et du vivant, Il fait sortir le mort. Et Il redonne la vie à la terre après sa mort. Et c'est ainsi que l'on vous fera sortir (à la résurrection)","translation_en":"He brings the living out of the dead and brings the dead out of the living and brings to life the earth after its lifelessness. And thus will you be brought out","transliteration":"Yukhriju alhayya mina almayyiti wayukhriju almayyita mina alhayyi wayuhyee alarda baAAda mawtiha wakathalika tukhrajoona"},{"id":20,"text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ أَنۡ خَلَقَكُم مِّن تُرَابٖ ثُمَّ إِذَآ أَنتُم بَشَرٞ تَنتَشِرُونَ","translation_fr":"Parmi Ses signes: Il vous a créés de terre, - puis, vous voilà des hommes qui se dispersent [dans le monde]","translation_en":"And of His signs is that He created you from dust; then, suddenly you were human beings dispersing [throughout the earth]","transliteration":"Wamin ayatihi an khalaqakum min turabin thumma itha antum basharun tantashiroona"},{"id":21,"text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ أَنۡ خَلَقَ لَكُم مِّنۡ أَنفُسِكُمۡ أَزۡوَٰجٗا لِّتَسۡكُنُوٓاْ إِلَيۡهَا وَجَعَلَ بَيۡنَكُم مَّوَدَّةٗ وَرَحۡمَةًۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ لِّقَوۡمٖ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","translation_fr":"Et parmi Ses signes Il a créé de vous, pour vous, des épouses pour que vous viviez en tranquillité avec elles et Il a mis entre vous de l'affection et de la bonté. Il y a en cela des preuves pour des gens qui réfléchissent","translation_en":"And of His signs is that He created for you from yourselves mates that you may find tranquillity in them; and He placed between you affection and mercy. Indeed in that are signs for a people who give thought","transliteration":"Wamin ayatihi an khalaqa lakum min anfusikum azwajan litaskunoo ilayha wajaAAala baynakum mawaddatan warahmatan inna fee thalika laayatin liqawmin yatafakkaroona"},{"id":22,"text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦ خَلۡقُ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَٱخۡتِلَٰفُ أَلۡسِنَتِكُمۡ وَأَلۡوَٰنِكُمۡۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ لِّلۡعَٰلِمِينَ","translation_fr":"Et parmi Ses signes la création des cieux et de la terre et la variété de vos idiomes et de vos couleurs. Il y a en cela des preuves pour les savants","translation_en":"And of His signs is the creation of the heavens and the earth and the diversity of your languages and your colors. Indeed in that are signs for those of knowledge","transliteration":"Wamin ayatihi khalqu alssamawati waalardi waikhtilafu alsinatikum waalwanikum inna fee thalika laayatin lilAAalimeena"},{"id":23,"text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦ مَنَامُكُم بِٱلَّيۡلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ وَٱبۡتِغَآؤُكُم مِّن فَضۡلِهِۦٓۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ لِّقَوۡمٖ يَسۡمَعُونَ","translation_fr":"Et parmi Ses signes votre sommeil la nuit et le jour, et aussi votre quête de Sa grâce. Il y a en cela des preuves pour des gens qui entendent","translation_en":"And of His signs is your sleep by night and day and your seeking of His bounty. Indeed in that are signs for a people who listen","transliteration":"Wamin ayatihi manamukum biallayli waalnnahari waibtighaokum min fadlihi inna fee thalika laayatin liqawmin yasmaAAoona"},{"id":24,"text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦ يُرِيكُمُ ٱلۡبَرۡقَ خَوۡفٗا وَطَمَعٗا وَيُنَزِّلُ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءٗ فَيُحۡيِۦ بِهِ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ بَعۡدَ مَوۡتِهَآۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ لِّقَوۡمٖ يَعۡقِلُونَ","translation_fr":"Et parmi Ses signes Il vous montre l'éclair avec crainte (de la foudre) et espoir (de la pluie), et fait descendre du ciel une eau avec laquelle Il redonne la vie à la terre après sa mort. Il y a en cela des preuves pour des gens qui raisonnent","translation_en":"And of His signs is [that] He shows you the lightning [causing] fear and aspiration, and He sends down rain from the sky by which He brings to life the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed in that are signs for a people who use reason","transliteration":"Wamin ayatihi yureekumu albarqa khawfan watamaAAan wayunazzilu mina alssamai maan fayuhyee bihi alarda baAAda mawtiha inna fee thalika laayatin liqawmin yaAAqiloona"},{"id":25,"text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ أَن تَقُومَ ٱلسَّمَآءُ وَٱلۡأَرۡضُ بِأَمۡرِهِۦۚ ثُمَّ إِذَا دَعَاكُمۡ دَعۡوَةٗ مِّنَ ٱلۡأَرۡضِ إِذَآ أَنتُمۡ تَخۡرُجُونَ","translation_fr":"Et parmi Ses signes le ciel et la terre sont maintenus par Son ordre; ensuite lorsqu'Il vous appellera d'un appel, voilà que de la terre vous surgirez","translation_en":"And of His signs is that the heaven and earth remain by His command. Then when He calls you with a [single] call from the earth, immediately you will come forth","transliteration":"Wamin ayatihi an taqooma alssamao waalardu biamrihi thumma itha daAAakum daAAwatan mina alardi itha antum takhrujoona"},{"id":26,"text":"وَلَهُۥ مَن فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۖ كُلّٞ لَّهُۥ قَٰنِتُونَ","translation_fr":"A Lui tous ceux qui sont dans les cieux et la terre: tous Lui sont entièrement soumis","translation_en":"And to Him belongs whoever is in the heavens and earth. All are to Him devoutly obedient","transliteration":"Walahu man fee alssamawati waalardi kullun lahu qanitoona"},{"id":27,"text":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِي يَبۡدَؤُاْ ٱلۡخَلۡقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ وَهُوَ أَهۡوَنُ عَلَيۡهِۚ وَلَهُ ٱلۡمَثَلُ ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۚ وَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلۡحَكِيمُ","translation_fr":"Et c'est Lui qui commence la création puis la refait; et cela Lui est plus facile. Il a la transcendance absolue dans les cieux et sur la terre. C'est Lui le Tout Puissant, le Sage","translation_en":"And it is He who begins creation; then He repeats it, and that is [even] easier for Him. To Him belongs the highest attribute in the heavens and earth. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise","transliteration":"Wahuwa allathee yabdao alkhalqa thumma yuAAeeduhu wahuwa ahwanu AAalayhi walahu almathalu alaAAla fee alssamawati waalardi wahuwa alAAazeezu alhakeemu"},{"id":28,"text":"ضَرَبَ لَكُم مَّثَلٗا مِّنۡ أَنفُسِكُمۡۖ هَل لَّكُم مِّن مَّا مَلَكَتۡ أَيۡمَٰنُكُم مِّن شُرَكَآءَ فِي مَا رَزَقۡنَٰكُمۡ فَأَنتُمۡ فِيهِ سَوَآءٞ تَخَافُونَهُمۡ كَخِيفَتِكُمۡ أَنفُسَكُمۡۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نُفَصِّلُ ٱلۡأٓيَٰتِ لِقَوۡمٖ يَعۡقِلُونَ","translation_fr":"Il vous a cité une parabole de vous-mêmes: Avez-vous associé vos esclaves à ce que Nous vous avons attribué en sorte que vous soyez tous égaux [en droit de propriété] et que vous les craignez [autant] que vous vous craignez mutuellement? C'est ainsi que Nous exposons Nos versets pour des gens qui raisonnent","translation_en":"He presents to you an example from yourselves. Do you have among those whom your right hands possess any partners in what We have provided for you so that you are equal therein [and] would fear them as your fear of one another [within a partnership]? Thus do We detail the verses for a people who use reason","transliteration":"Daraba lakum mathalan min anfusikum hal lakum mi mma malakat aymanukum min shurakaa fee ma razaqnakum faantum feehi sawaon takhafoonahum kakheefatikum anfusakum kathalika nufassilu alayati liqawmin yaAAqiloona"},{"id":29,"text":"بَلِ ٱتَّبَعَ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوٓاْ أَهۡوَآءَهُم بِغَيۡرِ عِلۡمٖۖ فَمَن يَهۡدِي مَنۡ أَضَلَّ ٱللَّهُۖ وَمَا لَهُم مِّن نَّـٰصِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Ceux qui ont été injustes ont plutôt suivi leurs propres passions, sans savoir. Qui donc peut guider celui qu'Allah égare? Et ils n'ont pas pour eux, de protecteur","translation_en":"But those who wrong follow their [own] desires without knowledge. Then who can guide one whom Allah has sent astray? And for them there are no helpers","transliteration":"Bali ittabaAAa allatheena thalamoo ahwaahum bighayri AAilmin faman yahdee man adalla Allahu wama lahum min nasireena"},{"id":30,"text":"فَأَقِمۡ وَجۡهَكَ لِلدِّينِ حَنِيفٗاۚ فِطۡرَتَ ٱللَّهِ ٱلَّتِي فَطَرَ ٱلنَّاسَ عَلَيۡهَاۚ لَا تَبۡدِيلَ لِخَلۡقِ ٱللَّهِۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلدِّينُ ٱلۡقَيِّمُ وَلَٰكِنَّ أَكۡثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Dirige tout ton être vers la religion exclusivement [pour Allah], telle est la nature qu'Allah a originellement donnée aux hommes - pas de changement à la création d'Allah -. Voilà la religion de droiture; mais la plupart des gens ne savent pas","translation_en":"So direct your face toward the religion, inclining to truth. [Adhere to] the fitrah of Allah upon which He has created [all] people. No change should there be in the creation of Allah. That is the correct religion, but most of the people do not know","transliteration":"Faaqim wajhaka lilddeeni haneefan fitrata Allahi allatee fatara alnnasa AAalayha la tabdeela likhalqi Allahi thalika alddeenu alqayyimu walakinna akthara alnnasi la yaAAlamoona"},{"id":31,"text":"۞مُنِيبِينَ إِلَيۡهِ وَٱتَّقُوهُ وَأَقِيمُواْ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَلَا تَكُونُواْ مِنَ ٱلۡمُشۡرِكِينَ","translation_fr":"Revenez repentants vers Lui; craignez-Le, accomplissez la Salât et ne soyez pas parmi les associateurs","translation_en":"[Adhere to it], turning in repentance to Him, and fear Him and establish prayer and do not be of those who associate others with Allah","transliteration":"Muneebeena ilayhi waittaqoohu waaqeemoo alssalata wala takoonoo mina almushrikeena"},{"id":32,"text":"مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ فَرَّقُواْ دِينَهُمۡ وَكَانُواْ شِيَعٗاۖ كُلُّ حِزۡبِۭ بِمَا لَدَيۡهِمۡ فَرِحُونَ","translation_fr":"parmi ceux qui ont divisé leur religion et sont devenus des sectes, chaque parti exultant de ce qu'il détenait","translation_en":"[Or] of those who have divided their religion and become sects, every faction rejoicing in what it has","transliteration":"Mina allatheena farraqoo deenahum wakanoo shiyaAAan kullu hizbin bima ladayhim farihoona"},{"id":33,"text":"وَإِذَا مَسَّ ٱلنَّاسَ ضُرّٞ دَعَوۡاْ رَبَّهُم مُّنِيبِينَ إِلَيۡهِ ثُمَّ إِذَآ أَذَاقَهُم مِّنۡهُ رَحۡمَةً إِذَا فَرِيقٞ مِّنۡهُم بِرَبِّهِمۡ يُشۡرِكُونَ","translation_fr":"Et quand un mal touche les gens, ils invoquent leur Seigneur en revenant à Lui repentants. Puis s'Il leur fait goûter de Sa part une miséricorde, voilà qu'une partie d'entre eux donnent à leur Seigneur des associés","translation_en":"And when adversity touches the people, they call upon their Lord, turning in repentance to Him. Then when He lets them taste mercy from Him, at once a party of them associate others with their Lord","transliteration":"Waitha massa alnnasa durrun daAAaw rabbahum muneebeena ilayhi thumma itha athaqahum minhu rahmatan itha fareequn minhum birabbihim yushrikoona"},{"id":34,"text":"لِيَكۡفُرُواْ بِمَآ ءَاتَيۡنَٰهُمۡۚ فَتَمَتَّعُواْ فَسَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"en sorte qu'ils deviennent ingrats envers ce que Nous leur avons donné. «Et jouissez donc. Vous saurez bientôt»","translation_en":"So that they will deny what We have granted them. Then enjoy yourselves, for you are going to know","transliteration":"Liyakfuroo bima ataynahum fatamattaAAoo fasawfa taAAlamoona"},{"id":35,"text":"أَمۡ أَنزَلۡنَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ سُلۡطَٰنٗا فَهُوَ يَتَكَلَّمُ بِمَا كَانُواْ بِهِۦ يُشۡرِكُونَ","translation_fr":"Avons-Nous fait descendre sur eux une autorité (un Livre) telle qu'elle parle de ce qu'ils Lui associaient","translation_en":"Or have We sent down to them an authority, and it speaks of what they were associating with Him","transliteration":"Am anzalna AAalayhim sultanan fahuwa yatakallamu bima kanoo bihi yushrikoona"},{"id":36,"text":"وَإِذَآ أَذَقۡنَا ٱلنَّاسَ رَحۡمَةٗ فَرِحُواْ بِهَاۖ وَإِن تُصِبۡهُمۡ سَيِّئَةُۢ بِمَا قَدَّمَتۡ أَيۡدِيهِمۡ إِذَا هُمۡ يَقۡنَطُونَ","translation_fr":"Et quand Nous faisons goûter une miséricorde aux gens, ils en exultent. Mais si un malheur les atteint à cause de ce que leurs propres mains ont préparé, voilà qu'ils désespèrent","translation_en":"And when We let the people taste mercy, they rejoice therein, but if evil afflicts them for what their hands have put forth, immediately they despair","transliteration":"Waitha athaqna alnnasa rahmatan farihoo biha wain tusibhum sayyiatun bima qaddamat aydeehim itha hum yaqnatoona"},{"id":37,"text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَرَوۡاْ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَبۡسُطُ ٱلرِّزۡقَ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيَقۡدِرُۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ لِّقَوۡمٖ يُؤۡمِنُونَ","translation_fr":"N'ont-ils pas vu qu'Allah dispense Ses dons ou les restreint à qui Il veut? Il y a en cela des preuves pour des gens qui croient","translation_en":"Do they not see that Allah extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it]? Indeed, in that are signs for a people who believe","transliteration":"Awalam yaraw anna Allaha yabsutu alrrizqa liman yashao wayaqdiru inna fee thalika laayatin liqawmin yuminoona"},{"id":38,"text":"فَـَٔاتِ ذَا ٱلۡقُرۡبَىٰ حَقَّهُۥ وَٱلۡمِسۡكِينَ وَٱبۡنَ ٱلسَّبِيلِۚ ذَٰلِكَ خَيۡرٞ لِّلَّذِينَ يُرِيدُونَ وَجۡهَ ٱللَّهِۖ وَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡمُفۡلِحُونَ","translation_fr":"Donne donc au proche parent son dû, ainsi qu'au pauvre, et au voyageur en détresse. Cela est meilleur pour ceux qui recherchent la face d'Allah (Sa satisfaction); et ce sont eux qui réussissent","translation_en":"So give the relative his right, as well as the needy and the traveler. That is best for those who desire the countenance of Allah, and it is they who will be the successful","transliteration":"Faati tha alqurba haqqahu waalmiskeena waibna alssabeeli thalika khayrun lillatheena yureedoona wajha Allahi waolaika humu almuflihoona"},{"id":39,"text":"وَمَآ ءَاتَيۡتُم مِّن رِّبٗا لِّيَرۡبُوَاْ فِيٓ أَمۡوَٰلِ ٱلنَّاسِ فَلَا يَرۡبُواْ عِندَ ٱللَّهِۖ وَمَآ ءَاتَيۡتُم مِّن زَكَوٰةٖ تُرِيدُونَ وَجۡهَ ٱللَّهِ فَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡمُضۡعِفُونَ","translation_fr":"Tout ce que vous donnerez à usure pour augmenter vos biens aux dépens des biens d'autrui ne les accroît pas auprès d'Allah, mais ce que vous donnez comme Zakât, tout en cherchant la Face d'Allah (Sa satisfaction)... Ceux-là verront [leurs récompenses] multipliées","translation_en":"And whatever you give for interest to increase within the wealth of people will not increase with Allah. But what you give in zakah, desiring the countenance of Allah - those are the multipliers","transliteration":"Wama ataytum min riban liyarbuwa fee amwali alnnasi fala yarboo AAinda Allahi wama ataytum min zakatin tureedoona wajha Allahi faolaika humu almudAAifoona"},{"id":40,"text":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَكُمۡ ثُمَّ رَزَقَكُمۡ ثُمَّ يُمِيتُكُمۡ ثُمَّ يُحۡيِيكُمۡۖ هَلۡ مِن شُرَكَآئِكُم مَّن يَفۡعَلُ مِن ذَٰلِكُم مِّن شَيۡءٖۚ سُبۡحَٰنَهُۥ وَتَعَٰلَىٰ عَمَّا يُشۡرِكُونَ","translation_fr":"C'est Allah qui vous a créés et vous a nourris. Ensuite Il vous fera mourir, puis Il vous redonnera vie. Y en a-t-il, parmi vos associés, qui fasse quoi que ce soit de tout cela? Gloire à Lui! Il transcende ce qu'on Lui associe","translation_en":"Allah is the one who created you, then provided for you, then will cause you to die, and then will give you life. Are there any of your \"partners\" who does anything of that? Exalted is He and high above what they associate with Him","transliteration":"Allahu allathee khalaqakum thumma razaqakum thumma yumeetukum thumma yuhyeekum hal min shurakaikum man yafAAalu min thalikum min shayin subhanahu wataAAala AAamma yushrikoona"},{"id":41,"text":"ظَهَرَ ٱلۡفَسَادُ فِي ٱلۡبَرِّ وَٱلۡبَحۡرِ بِمَا كَسَبَتۡ أَيۡدِي ٱلنَّاسِ لِيُذِيقَهُم بَعۡضَ ٱلَّذِي عَمِلُواْ لَعَلَّهُمۡ يَرۡجِعُونَ","translation_fr":"La corruption est apparue sur la terre et dans la mer à cause de ce que les gens ont accompli de leurs propres mains; afin qu'[Allah] leur fasse goûter une partie de ce qu'ils ont œuvré; peut-être reviendront-ils (vers Allah)","translation_en":"Corruption has appeared throughout the land and sea by [reason of] what the hands of people have earned so He may let them taste part of [the consequence of] what they have done that perhaps they will return [to righteousness]","transliteration":"Thahara alfasadu fee albarri waalbahri bima kasabat aydee alnnasi liyutheeqahum baAAda allathee AAamiloo laAAallahum yarjiAAoona"},{"id":42,"text":"قُلۡ سِيرُواْ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ فَٱنظُرُواْ كَيۡفَ كَانَ عَٰقِبَةُ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبۡلُۚ كَانَ أَكۡثَرُهُم مُّشۡرِكِينَ","translation_fr":"Dis: «Parcourez la terre et regardez ce qu'il est advenu de ceux qui ont vécu avant. La plupart d'entre eux étaient des associateurs»","translation_en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Travel through the land and observe how was the end of those before. Most of them were associators [of others with Allah]","transliteration":"Qul seeroo fee alardi faonthuroo kayfa kana AAaqibatu allatheena min qablu kana aktharuhum mushrikeena"},{"id":43,"text":"فَأَقِمۡ وَجۡهَكَ لِلدِّينِ ٱلۡقَيِّمِ مِن قَبۡلِ أَن يَأۡتِيَ يَوۡمٞ لَّا مَرَدَّ لَهُۥ مِنَ ٱللَّهِۖ يَوۡمَئِذٖ يَصَّدَّعُونَ","translation_fr":"Dirige tout ton être vers la religion de droiture, avant que ne vienne d'Allah un jour qu'on ne peut repousser. Ce jour-là [les gens] seront divisés","translation_en":"So direct your face toward the correct religion before a Day comes from Allah of which there is no repelling. That Day, they will be divided","transliteration":"Faaqim wajhaka lilddeeni alqayyimi min qabli an yatiya yawmun la maradda lahu mina Allahi yawmaithin yassaddaAAoona"},{"id":44,"text":"مَن كَفَرَ فَعَلَيۡهِ كُفۡرُهُۥۖ وَمَنۡ عَمِلَ صَٰلِحٗا فَلِأَنفُسِهِمۡ يَمۡهَدُونَ","translation_fr":"Celui qui aura mécru subira [les conséquences] de son infidélité. Et quiconque aura œuvré en bien... C'est pour eux-mêmes qu'ils préparent (leur avenir)","translation_en":"Whoever disbelieves - upon him is [the consequence of] his disbelief. And whoever does righteousness - they are for themselves preparing","transliteration":"Man kafara faAAalayhi kufruhu waman AAamila salihan falianfusihim yamhadoona"},{"id":45,"text":"لِيَجۡزِيَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ مِن فَضۡلِهِۦٓۚ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","translation_fr":"afin qu'[Allah] récompense par Sa grâce ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres. En vérité, Il n'aime pas les infidèles","translation_en":"That He may reward those who have believed and done righteous deeds out of His bounty. Indeed, He does not like the disbelievers","transliteration":"Liyajziya allatheena amanoo waAAamiloo alssalihati min fadlihi innahu la yuhibbu alkafireena"},{"id":46,"text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ أَن يُرۡسِلَ ٱلرِّيَاحَ مُبَشِّرَٰتٖ وَلِيُذِيقَكُم مِّن رَّحۡمَتِهِۦ وَلِتَجۡرِيَ ٱلۡفُلۡكُ بِأَمۡرِهِۦ وَلِتَبۡتَغُواْ مِن فَضۡلِهِۦ وَلَعَلَّكُمۡ تَشۡكُرُونَ","translation_fr":"Parmi Ses signes, Il envoie les vents comme annonciateurs, pour vous faire goûter de Sa miséricorde et pour que le vaisseau vogue, par Son ordre, et que vous recherchiez de Sa grâce. Peut-être seriez-vous reconnaissants","translation_en":"And of His signs is that He sends the winds as bringers of good tidings and to let you taste His mercy and so the ships may sail at His command and so you may seek of His bounty, and perhaps you will be grateful","transliteration":"Wamin ayatihi an yursila alrriyaha mubashshiratin waliyutheeqakum min rahmatihi walitajriya alfulku biamrihi walitabtaghoo min fadlihi walaAAallakum tashkuroona"},{"id":47,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ أَرۡسَلۡنَا مِن قَبۡلِكَ رُسُلًا إِلَىٰ قَوۡمِهِمۡ فَجَآءُوهُم بِٱلۡبَيِّنَٰتِ فَٱنتَقَمۡنَا مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَجۡرَمُواْۖ وَكَانَ حَقًّا عَلَيۡنَا نَصۡرُ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous avons effectivement envoyé avant toi des Messagers vers leurs peuples et ils leur apportèrent les preuves. Nous Nous vengeâmes de ceux qui commirent les crimes [de la négation]; et c'était Notre devoir de secourir les croyants","translation_en":"And We have already sent messengers before you to their peoples, and they came to them with clear evidences; then We took retribution from those who committed crimes, and incumbent upon Us was support of the believers","transliteration":"Walaqad arsalna min qablika rusulan ila qawmihim fajaoohum bialbayyinati faintaqamna mina allatheena ajramoo wakana haqqan AAalayna nasru almumineena"},{"id":48,"text":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِي يُرۡسِلُ ٱلرِّيَٰحَ فَتُثِيرُ سَحَابٗا فَيَبۡسُطُهُۥ فِي ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيۡفَ يَشَآءُ وَيَجۡعَلُهُۥ كِسَفٗا فَتَرَى ٱلۡوَدۡقَ يَخۡرُجُ مِنۡ خِلَٰلِهِۦۖ فَإِذَآ أَصَابَ بِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ مِنۡ عِبَادِهِۦٓ إِذَا هُمۡ يَسۡتَبۡشِرُونَ","translation_fr":"Allah, c'est Lui qui envoie les vents qui soulèvent des nuages; puis Il les étend dans le ciel comme Il veut; et Il les met en morceaux. Tu vois alors la pluie sortir de leurs profondeurs. Puis, lorsqu'Il atteint avec elle qui Il veut parmi Ses serviteurs, les voilà qui se réjouissent","translation_en":"It is Allah who sends the winds, and they stir the clouds and spread them in the sky however He wills, and He makes them fragments so you see the rain emerge from within them. And when He causes it to fall upon whom He wills of His servants, immediately they rejoice","transliteration":"Allahu allathee yursilu alrriyaha fatutheeru sahaban fayabsutuhu fee alssamai kayfa yashao wayajAAaluhu kisafan fatara alwadqa yakhruju min khilalihi faitha asaba bihi man yashao min AAibadihi itha hum yastabshiroona"},{"id":49,"text":"وَإِن كَانُواْ مِن قَبۡلِ أَن يُنَزَّلَ عَلَيۡهِم مِّن قَبۡلِهِۦ لَمُبۡلِسِينَ","translation_fr":"même s'ils étaient auparavant, avant qu'on ne l'ait fait descendre sur eux, désespérés","translation_en":"Although they were, before it was sent down upon them - before that, in despair","transliteration":"Wain kanoo min qabli an yunazzala AAalayhim min qablihi lamubliseena"},{"id":50,"text":"فَٱنظُرۡ إِلَىٰٓ ءَاثَٰرِ رَحۡمَتِ ٱللَّهِ كَيۡفَ يُحۡيِ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ بَعۡدَ مَوۡتِهَآۚ إِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ لَمُحۡيِ ٱلۡمَوۡتَىٰۖ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيۡءٖ قَدِيرٞ","translation_fr":"Regarde donc les effets de la miséricorde d'Allah comment Il redonne la vie à la terre après sa mort. C'est Lui qui fait revivre les morts et Il est Omnipotent","translation_en":"So observe the effects of the mercy of Allah - how He gives life to the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed, that [same one] will give life to the dead, and He is over all things competent","transliteration":"Faonthur ila athari rahmati Allahi kayfa yuhyee alarda baAAda mawtiha inna thalika lamuhyee almawta wahuwa AAala kulli shayin qadeerun"},{"id":51,"text":"وَلَئِنۡ أَرۡسَلۡنَا رِيحٗا فَرَأَوۡهُ مُصۡفَرّٗا لَّظَلُّواْ مِنۢ بَعۡدِهِۦ يَكۡفُرُونَ","translation_fr":"Et si Nous envoyons un vent et qu'ils voient jaunir [leur végétation], ils demeurent après cela ingrats (oubliant les bienfaits antérieurs)","translation_en":"But if We should send a [bad] wind and they saw [their crops] turned yellow, they would remain thereafter disbelievers","transliteration":"Walain arsalna reehan faraawhu musfarran lathalloo min baAAdihi yakfuroona"},{"id":52,"text":"فَإِنَّكَ لَا تُسۡمِعُ ٱلۡمَوۡتَىٰ وَلَا تُسۡمِعُ ٱلصُّمَّ ٱلدُّعَآءَ إِذَا وَلَّوۡاْ مُدۡبِرِينَ","translation_fr":"En vérité, tu ne fais pas entendre les morts; et tu ne fais pas entendre aux sourds l'appel, s'ils s'en vont en tournant le dos","translation_en":"So indeed, you will not make the dead hear, nor will you make the deaf hear the call when they turn their backs, retreating","transliteration":"Fainnaka la tusmiAAu almawta wala tusmiAAu alssumma aldduAAaa itha wallaw mudbireena"},{"id":53,"text":"وَمَآ أَنتَ بِهَٰدِ ٱلۡعُمۡيِ عَن ضَلَٰلَتِهِمۡۖ إِن تُسۡمِعُ إِلَّا مَن يُؤۡمِنُ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا فَهُم مُّسۡلِمُونَ","translation_fr":"Tu n'es pas celui qui guide les aveugles hors de leur égarement. Tu ne fais entendre que ceux qui croient en Nos versets et qui sont alors entièrement soumis [musulmans]","translation_en":"And you cannot guide the blind away from their error. You will only make hear those who believe in Our verses so they are Muslims [in submission to Allah]","transliteration":"Wama anta bihadi alAAumyi AAan dalalatihim in tusmiAAu illa man yuminu biayatina fahum muslimoona"},{"id":54,"text":"۞ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَكُم مِّن ضَعۡفٖ ثُمَّ جَعَلَ مِنۢ بَعۡدِ ضَعۡفٖ قُوَّةٗ ثُمَّ جَعَلَ مِنۢ بَعۡدِ قُوَّةٖ ضَعۡفٗا وَشَيۡبَةٗۚ يَخۡلُقُ مَا يَشَآءُۚ وَهُوَ ٱلۡعَلِيمُ ٱلۡقَدِيرُ","translation_fr":"Allah, c'est Lui qui vous a créés faibles; puis après la faiblesse, Il vous donne la force; puis après la force, Il vous réduit à la faiblesse et à la vieillesse: Il crée ce qu'Il veut et c'est Lui l'Omniscient, l'Omnipotent","translation_en":"Allah is the one who created you from weakness, then made after weakness strength, then made after strength weakness and white hair. He creates what He wills, and He is the Knowing, the Competent","transliteration":"Allahu allathee khalaqakum min daAAfin thumma jaAAala min baAAdi daAAfin quwwatan thumma jaAAala min baAAdi quwwatin daAAfan washaybatan yakhluqu ma yashao wahuwa alAAaleemu alqadeeru"},{"id":55,"text":"وَيَوۡمَ تَقُومُ ٱلسَّاعَةُ يُقۡسِمُ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُونَ مَا لَبِثُواْ غَيۡرَ سَاعَةٖۚ كَذَٰلِكَ كَانُواْ يُؤۡفَكُونَ","translation_fr":"Et le jour où l'Heure arrivera, les criminels jureront qu'ils n'ont demeuré qu'une heure. C'est ainsi qu'ils ont été détournés (de la vérité)","translation_en":"And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will swear they had remained but an hour. Thus they were deluded","transliteration":"Wayawma taqoomu alssaAAatu yuqsimu almujrimoona ma labithoo ghayra saAAatin kathalika kanoo yufakoona"},{"id":56,"text":"وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُواْ ٱلۡعِلۡمَ وَٱلۡإِيمَٰنَ لَقَدۡ لَبِثۡتُمۡ فِي كِتَٰبِ ٱللَّهِ إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ ٱلۡبَعۡثِۖ فَهَٰذَا يَوۡمُ ٱلۡبَعۡثِ وَلَٰكِنَّكُمۡ كُنتُمۡ لَا تَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"tandis que ceux à qui le savoir et la foi furent donnés diront: «Vous avez demeuré d'après le Décret d'Allah, jusqu'au Jour de la Résurrection, voici le Jour de la Résurrection, - mais vous ne saviez point»","translation_en":"But those who were given knowledge and faith will say, \"You remained the extent of Allah 's decree until the Day of Resurrection, and this is the Day of Resurrection, but you did not used to know","transliteration":"Waqala allatheena ootoo alAAilma waaleemana laqad labithtum fee kitabi Allahi ila yawmi albaAAthi fahatha yawmu albaAAthi walakinnakum kuntum la taAAlamoona"},{"id":57,"text":"فَيَوۡمَئِذٖ لَّا يَنفَعُ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُواْ مَعۡذِرَتُهُمۡ وَلَا هُمۡ يُسۡتَعۡتَبُونَ","translation_fr":"ce jour-là donc, les excuses ne seront pas utiles aux injustes et on ne leur demandera pas à chercher à plaire à [Allah]","translation_en":"So that Day, their excuse will not benefit those who wronged, nor will they be asked to appease [Allah]","transliteration":"Fayawmaithin la yanfaAAu allatheena thalamoo maAAthiratuhum wala hum yustaAAtaboona"},{"id":58,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ ضَرَبۡنَا لِلنَّاسِ فِي هَٰذَا ٱلۡقُرۡءَانِ مِن كُلِّ مَثَلٖۚ وَلَئِن جِئۡتَهُم بِـَٔايَةٖ لَّيَقُولَنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓاْ إِنۡ أَنتُمۡ إِلَّا مُبۡطِلُونَ","translation_fr":"Et dans ce Coran, Nous avons certes cité, pour les gens, des exemples de toutes sortes. Et si tu leur apportes un prodige, ceux qui ne croient pas diront: «Certes, vous n'êtes que des imposteurs»","translation_en":"And We have certainly presented to the people in this Qur'an from every [kind of] example. But, [O Muhammad], if you should bring them a sign, the disbelievers will surely say, \"You [believers] are but falsifiers","transliteration":"Walaqad darabna lilnnasi fee hatha alqurani min kulli mathalin walain jitahum biayatin layaqoolanna allatheena kafaroo in antum illa mubtiloona"},{"id":59,"text":"كَذَٰلِكَ يَطۡبَعُ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"C'est ainsi qu'Allah scelle les cœurs de ceux qui ne savent pas","translation_en":"Thus does Allah seal the hearts of those who do not know","transliteration":"Kathalika yatbaAAu Allahu AAala quloobi allatheena la yaAAlamoona"},{"id":60,"text":"فَٱصۡبِرۡ إِنَّ وَعۡدَ ٱللَّهِ حَقّٞۖ وَلَا يَسۡتَخِفَّنَّكَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُوقِنُونَ","translation_fr":"Sois donc patient, car la promesse d'Allah est vérité. Et que ceux qui ne croient pas fermement ne t'ébranlent pas","translation_en":"So be patient. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And let them not disquiet you who are not certain [in faith]","transliteration":"Faisbir inna waAAda Allahi haqqun wala yastakhiffannaka allatheena la yooqinoona"}]}